<title>USA: N.J. $53.6 mln waste deal won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>N.J. $53.6 mln waste deal won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Wednesday it won $53.6 million New Jersey Wastewater Treatment Trust bonds at a true interest cost of 5.028 percent.</p>
</text>
